params:path {
  id: 1e54776b-9910-4742-9f8c-8efd23912d4a
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  One teacher, with `time_off` embedded. Includes deactivated teachers, unlike
  the public route.

  ## API example response
  {
    "id": "1e54776b-9910-4742-9f8c-8efd23912d4a",
